{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01404",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 2.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.36,
      "end_seconds": 9.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.32,
      "end_seconds": 16.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Good morning, um, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.3,
      "end_seconds": 21.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "good, that'll be useful pull up a chair"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 22.84,
      "end_seconds": 27.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "so, she's been having a long seizure, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.55,
      "end_seconds": 33.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "right, did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.38,
      "end_seconds": 35.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "just since yesterday"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.59,
      "end_seconds": 38.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.05,
      "end_seconds": 43.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Honestly, once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.28,
      "end_seconds": 47.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.4,
      "end_seconds": 54.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "let me think, a a seven out of ten, I suppose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.32,
      "end_seconds": 58.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.14,
      "end_seconds": 65.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Being drowsy and confused afterwards goes along with it, most of the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.37,
      "end_seconds": 73.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 73.19,
      "end_seconds": 80.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "So, you know, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.39,
      "end_seconds": 95.65,
      "duration_seconds": 14.26,
      "text": "I was getting to that! As for being drowsy and confused afterwards, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.35,
      "end_seconds": 100.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.07,
      "end_seconds": 103.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I, I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.82,
      "end_seconds": 106.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "So, any fever or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.5,
      "end_seconds": 119.5,
      "duration_seconds": 11.0,
      "text": "no, no fever, no head injury. I was biting my tongue at one point, but that went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.57,
      "end_seconds": 124.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.47,
      "end_seconds": 127.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "no changes there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.56,
      "end_seconds": 146.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.62,
      "end_seconds": 150.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I have epilepsy, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.73,
      "end_seconds": 153.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.37,
      "end_seconds": 160.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "I have anxiety. I just want to get back to normal, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.33,
      "end_seconds": 163.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.73,
      "end_seconds": 172.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "I've, I've had eczema for two years now. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.64,
      "end_seconds": 180.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Okay, I can see epilepsy and eczema in your file as well. And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.58,
      "end_seconds": 187.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.06,
      "end_seconds": 190.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.42,
      "end_seconds": 196.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.26,
      "end_seconds": 202.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "are you in work at the the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.14,
      "end_seconds": 209.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.79,
      "end_seconds": 213.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.09,
      "end_seconds": 218.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.89,
      "end_seconds": 222.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.74,
      "end_seconds": 229.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Yes, I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.0,
      "end_seconds": 234.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.0,
      "end_seconds": 243.37,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "I was told I'm allergic to wheat, but I don't remember what reaction I had."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.89,
      "end_seconds": 248.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.57,
      "end_seconds": 257.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "It's, It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a little pink tablet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.17,
      "end_seconds": 261.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.99,
      "end_seconds": 274.92,
      "duration_seconds": 12.93,
      "text": "For the fits, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. Hydrocortisone cream. I take it when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.38,
      "end_seconds": 280.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Alright, is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.93,
      "end_seconds": 286.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.35,
      "end_seconds": 291.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.6,
      "end_seconds": 308.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.23,
      "end_seconds": 333.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 112 beats a minute, blood pressure 130 over 70, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.21,
      "end_seconds": 337.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.91,
      "end_seconds": 342.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.27,
      "end_seconds": 349.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.33,
      "end_seconds": 351.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.54,
      "end_seconds": 366.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "You are drowsy and confused, and there is blood on your tongue."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.7,
      "end_seconds": 371.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.76,
      "end_seconds": 400.68,
      "duration_seconds": 19.92,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like a prolonged seizure in a person with epilepsy. A missed dose of medicine is still possible. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had a long seizure, yesterday, and no fever or head injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.86,
      "end_seconds": 404.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Yes, um, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.51,
      "end_seconds": 428.74,
      "duration_seconds": 23.23,
      "text": "We should do a blood sugar for seizure. I'm sending you for blood tests including drug levels because of seizure. Let's use lorazepam, 4 milligrams, once now, single dose. That should help with prolonged seizure. Lie on your side while we monitor you. I'd like you to see the emergency team as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 429.85,
      "end_seconds": 431.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 433.28,
      "end_seconds": 441.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.2,
      "text": "We'll catch up straight away. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 441.98,
      "end_seconds": 450.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "so, I take the lorazepam, 4 milligrams, once now and come back straight away is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 451.75,
      "end_seconds": 458.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "yes, exactly right right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 460.39,
      "end_seconds": 464.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "mm, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 466.0,
      "end_seconds": 467.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "see you soon"
    }
  ]
}